<title>USA: Bull Run to buy back small lot shares.</title>
<headline>Bull Run to buy back small lot shares.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bull Run Corp said Friday it would offer to buy back its stock from shareholders owning fewer than 100 shares.</p>
<p>The shares will be repurchased at the average closing price of the shares in the period January 2-31, it said.</p>
<p>Bull Run said it has estimated that about 450 shareholders with an aggregate of about 16,000 shares -- or less than 0.1 percent of the total shares outstanding -- would be eligible for the buyback program.</p>
</text>
